st_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-03T10:01:51Z","updated_at":"2025-03-03T10:02:12Z","body":"Confirmed it doesn't work with `TileMapLayers` or Groups. I'll need to work on a solution for each of them and ammend this PR when ready.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2693844878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707502719","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103365#issuecomment-2707502719","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103365","id":2707502719,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hYTZ_","user":{"login":"TheSofox","id":3089525,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODk1MjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3089525?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox","html_url":"https://github.com/TheSofox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-07T21:34:03Z","updated_at":"2025-03-08T15:21:54Z","body":"Pushed a new version. Should handle `TileMapLayer` and Groups! (EDIT: Tweaked solution, and more comment below)\r\n\r\n> Not sure if fetching z-index from RenderingServer is correct 🤔\r\n\r\nAt the end of the day, we need the final rendering position of all the elements. Either we get the value from the `RenderingServer` or we copy all the calculations that the `RenderingServer` does to somewhere else which just leads to replicated code. More of my words on why we need to access `RenderingServer` can be found here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/96576#issuecomment-2401164637\r\n\r\nThis PR handles stuff `show_behind_parent`, `top_level`, `y_sort_enabled` because it gets the Z values after all this stuff has already been calculated. If more stuff is introduced that can change how `CanvasItems` are ordered, my code should handle it since it's getting the raw render order of things being drawn to the screen.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2707502719/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2711764632","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103365#issuecomment-2711764632","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103365","id":2711764632,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hoj6Y","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/